  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p><strong>Averill Mahjong creates thoughtfully designed American mahjong sets for gathering, gifting, and keeping close.</strong>  </p><p>Our signature Monet’s Garden set pairs 160 engraved acrylic tiles with hand-illustrated floral artwork, coral-orange backs, four quick-reference cards, an instruction booklet, a zippered pouch, and gift-ready packaging.  </p><p>We are looking for US-based creators, mahjong players, hosts, gift guides, lifestyle publishers, and community leaders whose audiences appreciate beautiful game nights, thoughtful entertaining, and design-led gifts.  </p><p>Affiliates earn <strong>10% commission on qualified sales</strong> made through their unique link or coupon code. At the current $159.99 promotional price, that is about $16 per approved order. We provide product imagery and promotional support; selected partners may also be considered for product seeding or custom campaigns.  </p><p>Please promote Averill with honest, original content. Clearly disclose affiliate relationships, use approved brand assets, and do not bid on branded keywords or run misleading discount claims.</p></div></div>",
